          "description": {
            "en": "In a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: she wants to be a wizard. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and she was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious traveling magician. After secretly watching him perform magic in a way she's never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody \"knows\" might not be the truth and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it seems...\n___  \n- Winner of the 2020 Eisner Award for Best U.S. Edition of International Material-Asia.  \n- Winner of the Best Manga award at the 2020 Harvey Awards.\n___\n**Officially licensed:**  \n- In English by [Kodansha](https://kodansha.us/series/witch-hat-atelier/) as *Witch Hat Atelier*\n- Indonesian by [Elex Media](https://elexmedia.id/detail/produk/Atelier-of-Witch-Hat-01/9786020458892/pencarian) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In German by [Egmont Manga](https://www.egmont-manga.de/series/Atelier%20of%20Witch%20Hat) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In Spanish by [Milky Way Ediciones](https://www.milkywayediciones.com/collections/all/atelier-of-witch-hat) as *Atelier of Witch Hat: El Atelier de Sombreros de Mago*\n- In French by [Pika](https://www.pika.fr/serie/latelier-des-sorciers) as *L'Atelier des Sorciers* \n- In Italian by [Panini Comics](https://www.panini.it/shp_ita_it/atelier-of-witch-hat-1-matel001isbn-it08.html) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In Brazilian Portuguese by [Panini Comics](https://loja.panini.com.br/panini/produto/Manga-Atelier-of-Witch-Hat-1.aspx) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In Polish by [Kotori](http://kotori.pl/nasze-wydania/atelier-spiczastych-kapeluszy/) as *Atelier spiczastych kapeluszy*\n- In Russian by [\u0418\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u0438 \u041a\u043e\u043c\u0438\u043a\u0441](https://istari.ru/katalog-knig/manga/istari-comics/atel_e_koldovs